  "ingredients": [
    "4 potatoes",
    "4 large eggs",
    "0.5 cup mayonnaise",
    "0.5 stalk celery, chopped",
    "0.25 cup sweet relish",
    "1 clove garlic, minced",
    "2 tablespoons prepared mustard",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pHrwOpTcABl0Ci2NgzESktDoscc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-16727-SouthernPotatoSalad-ddmfs-step1-3x4-6184-e1dd1aadee9c4ebea72001dee69e8573.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16727/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Add potatoes and cook until tender but still firm, about 15 minutes; drain and chop.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/utfBAv6yMuJ_SA-vDLKwmEAPDdU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-16727-SouthernPotatoSalad-ddmfs-step3-3x4-6218-2977331cf54d4d08aef14ca104a2bd95.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16727/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "At the same time, place eggs in a saucepan and cover with cold water. Bring water to a boil; cover, remove from heat, and let eggs stand in hot water for 10 to 12 minutes. Remove from hot water; peel and chop.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SeAb8lvOroPdW4K0y3ev0Zp3vh4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-16727-SouthernPotatoSalad-ddmfs-step5-3x4-6215-4ef4bea058a8415b8241d6f3d8a1ca75.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16727/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine cooked and chopped potatoes and eggs with mayonnaise, celery, relish, garlic, mustard, salt, and pepper in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EOaOxvvZkF9qJGi4qTPjVzmFeSc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-16727-SouthernPotatoSalad-ddmfs-step6-3x4-6220-1741e8024ba94917a554cfc76ce03c30.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16727/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently mix together and serve warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U72eqSB3BZm-kroTDRnaTRezf8o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-16727-SouthernPotatoSalad-ddmfs-3x4-6254-b3052e92d11747bbbddfd9b563ff54b3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16727/step_05.webp"
    }
